  "description": "Temporary testing preview of the independent OpenStaadSessionProvider for Windows .NET 8 applications. Requires Windows Desktop/WPF and installed licensed Bentley STAAD.Pro. Not a stable production release. Assembly and namespaces remain StaadPro.Interop; do not reference alongside the main package.",
