  "releaseNotes": "Testing-only Windows .NET 8 preview. Adds verified existing-model acquisition, retained roots, conservative blank validation, atomic non-overwriting target preparation, process-verified startup, discovery policies and immutable diagnostics. The legacy provider and OpenStaadWrapper source remain unchanged. Managed tests pass on net481 and net8.0-windows; controlled native acquisition tests passed on STAAD.Pro 2026. Unmapped blank instances, synchronous COM hangs and other vendor versions remain limitations. This package has a separate ID and may be unlisted after testing. Guide: https://github.com/structuraldeveloper/StaadPro.Interop/blob/main-wrapper-redesign/docs/Core-Testing-Package.md",
